  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Economic Security Bureau of Ukraine (ESBU) contacted the Swedish Economic Crime Authority and the Swedish Tax Authority back in 2022 regarding Swedish support for capacity and institutional development.

The Swedish Tax Authority therefore intends to carry out a so-called &quot;design phase&quot; to identify areas where ESBU could benefit from cooperation with the Tax Agency and the Economic Crime Agency.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Economic Security Bureau of Ukraine (ESBU) kontaktade Ekobrottsmyndigheten och Skatteverket redan 2022 om ett svenskt st&#xF6;d avseende kapacitets- och institutionsutveckling. 

Skatteverket, avser d&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r att genomf&#xF6;ra en s.k. &quot;designfas&quot; f&#xF6;r att identifiera omr&#xE5;den d&#xE4;r ESBU skulle kunna dra nytta av ett samarbete med Skatteverket och Ekobrottsmyndigheten.</narrative>
  </description>
